  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>*重要提示！！！*：由於「Zombies Revamped」使用自訂實體模型與貼圖，此套件需要以下項目：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>*<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a> + <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Features</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;…或 <em>替代方案</em>：</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14px\"><strong>*<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" rel=\"nofollow\">OPTIFINE</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一個重製殭屍並基於新預設皮膚新增多種變體的套件！</p>\n<p>我以更接近「原版風格」來製作此套件，同時仍為它們帶來必要的重製。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8WVZPN3CB70?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此套件新增了冰凍殭屍、沙漠殭屍、爬行殭屍等更多類型！&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>僅限名稱標籤的殭屍皮膚／變體：</p>\n<p>- <strong>Jesse</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>攀岩殭屍</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>投擲殭屍</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>Valorie</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>Hex</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>Adriene</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>Hal</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>Kureiji Ollie</strong></p>\n<p>-<strong>&nbsp;新娘 Ollie</strong></p>\n<p>-<strong>&nbsp;甜心 Ollie</strong></p>\n<p>-<strong>&nbsp;忍者 Ollie</strong></p>\n<p>-<strong>&nbsp;Olivia&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請確保以下選項皆設定為「<strong>開啟</strong>」：</p>\n<p><strong>自訂實體模型</strong><br><strong>隨機實體</strong></p>\n<p><strong>發光貼圖</strong></p>\n<p>您可以透過以下路徑找到這些切換選項：</p>\n<p><strong>選項&gt;影片設定&gt;品質</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此外還有支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/als-zombies-revamped-x-fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations 的版本</a>！</p>",
